Position:
Marketing Project Manager
Location:
Dubai
Reporting to:
Global Head of Marketing
Type:
Full-time

Company Overview
:
We’re looking for a Marketing Project Manager
who knows how to turn ideas into high-impact campaigns - and actually get things done. If you thrive in a fast-paced environment, can juggle multiple projects across teams, and understand both digital marketing and offline activations, this role is for you.

About the Role:

As a Marketing Project Manager, you’ll be at the center of our marketing engine - owning the execution of campaigns across digital and offline channels. You’ll work cross-functionally with marketing, product, sales, compliance, and external partners to launch campaigns that drive real business results. This is not a “just coordination” role - we’re looking for someone who takes ownership and delivers.

What You’ll Do

Lead end-to-end marketing projects from planning to execution;
Manage and execute digital marketing campaigns (paid media, CRM, affiliates, social, webinars);
Coordinate offline initiatives (exhibitions, events);
Work cross-functionally with multiple teams to ensure smooth execution;
Define timelines, priorities, and deliverables - and make sure they happen;
Track campaign performance and optimize based on data;
Manage multiple projects simultaneously in a fast-moving environment;
Handle ad-hoc campaigns and urgent launches with speed and precision;
Independently launch Facebook ads, prepare presentations for webinars, organize in-person meetings with potential clients, and so on.

Who We’re Looking For

3-6+ years in marketing project management / marketing operations;
Experience in Forex, CFD, Crypto, Fintech, or similar industries is a strong plus;
Proven track record managing both digital campaigns and offline events;
Strong project management and organizational skills;
Ability to work across teams - not just within marketing;
Solid understanding of performance marketing channels;
Comfortable working in a fast-paced, high-pressure environment;
Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills.

Nice to Have

Familiarity with compliance-driven marketing environments;
Experience managing multi-region campaigns;
Hands-on experience with tools like Asana, ClickUp, Jira, or similar.

Added Advantage:

Previous work experience in forex or finance trading industry
Strong awareness of market trends, emerging technologies and new finTech products and business model

*
Due to the high volume of applications, only shortlisted candidates will be contacted. We truly appreciate your interest and understanding .

